graph TD
    subgraph GovernanceAndSecurity[Security, Governance & Observability]
        IAM[Workspace, Identity & Access]
        Settings[Environment Settings & Secrets]
        Policy[Policy Center]
        Audit[Audit & Compliance]
        Analytics[Platform Analytics]
        Tracing[Trace Engine]
    end

    subgraph CoreOrchestration[Conversational & Execution Core]
        Conversation[Conversation Engine]
        Workflow[Workflow & Execution]
        Prompt[Prompt Engine]
        Knowledge[Knowledge Engine]
        Intelligence[Intelligence Engine]
        Evaluation[Evaluation Engine]
        Plugins[Plugin Engine]
    end

    subgraph OperationsControl[Platform Operations]
        Operations[Operations & DR Control Plane]
    end

    IAM -->|tenant & actor context| Conversation
    IAM -->|role & permission scope| Policy
    IAM -->|mutation audit facts| Audit

    Settings -->|effective runtime config| Intelligence
    Settings -->|pricing & secrets| Policy

    Conversation -->|workflow reference| Workflow
    Conversation -->|memory / context| Intelligence
    Workflow -->|render prompt| Prompt
    Workflow -->|query package| Knowledge
    Workflow -->|planned execution| Intelligence

    Knowledge -->|retrieval policy| Policy
    Prompt -->|version governance| Policy
    Intelligence -->|execution guardrails| Policy
    Intelligence -->|execution result| Evaluation

    Plugins -. implement retriever .-> Knowledge
    Plugins -. implement provider .-> Intelligence
    Plugins -. extension health .-> Operations

    Conversation -. facts & telemetry .-> Tracing
    Workflow -. facts & telemetry .-> Tracing
    Intelligence -. facts & telemetry .-> Tracing
    Evaluation -. facts & telemetry .-> Tracing

    Conversation -. usage & turns .-> Analytics
    Intelligence -. tokens & cost ZAR .-> Analytics
    Policy -. decisions .-> Analytics

    Operations -->|snapshots & recovery| Conversation
    Operations -->|governed deployments| Settings

    style IAM fill:#e0e7ff,stroke:#4338ca,stroke-width:2px
    style Policy fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#b91c1c,stroke-width:2px
    style Intelligence fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#1d4ed8,stroke-width:2px
    style Analytics fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#15803d,stroke-width:2px
    style Operations fill:#ffedd5,stroke:#c2410c,stroke-width:2px
